// Planted SEVERAL CHAINS (27 Sep 2026, profile 1.5): two boats sharing a state. Drought drives
// migration, which clears forest (what the first chain explains); forest cover then sets the
// water table (where the second begins, so its role there is a condition, not an outcome). One
// step belongs to no chain, and the second chain has a gap of its own.
===
title: "Chains -- two planted boats"
mechanism:
    question: "How do migration and water tables couple through the forest?"
    levels: [macro, micro]
    actors:
        region:   {label: "The region", level: macro}
        families: {label: "Farming families", level: micro}
    states:
        drought:   {label: "Drought", actor: region, role: condition}
        migration: {label: "Migration", actor: families}
        forest:    {label: "Forest cover", actor: region, role: outcome}
        water:     {label: "Water table", actor: region, role: outcome}
        wells:     {label: "Well digging", actor: families}
    chains:
        drought:
            label: "Drought and migration"
            question: "Why does drought clear the forest?"
        water:
            label: "Forest and water"
            question: "What does forest loss do to the water table?"
            roles: {forest: condition}
===

[The coupling]: Migration and water tables are coupled through the forest.

[Drought drives migration]: Drought drives families to migrate.
    {causes: {from: drought, to: migration, sign: "+", basis: asserted, chain: drought}}
    +> [The coupling]

[Migration clears forest]: Migrants clear forest for farmland.
    {causes: {from: migration, to: forest, sign: "-", basis: asserted, chain: drought}}
    +> [The coupling]

[Forest holds water]: Forest cover holds up the water table.
    {causes: {from: forest, to: water, sign: "+", basis: asserted, chain: water}}
    +> [The coupling]

[Falling water sets people digging]: A falling water table sets families digging wells.
    {causes: {from: water, to: wells, sign: "-", basis: asserted, chain: water}}
    +> [The coupling]

[Drought lowers water]: Drought lowers the water table.
    {causes: {from: drought, to: water, sign: "-", basis: asserted}}
    +> [The coupling]
